{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-kelly-hoppen-debossed-cappuccino-cups-2512-0159","content_id":"df311f72-10a4-4357-abaf-096c12bbd108","description":"Product Recall for Kelly Hoppen Debossed Cappuccino Cups presenting a burns and injuries risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"694a201e-bf57-452c-83a7-3c94e82c5413","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-15T17:03:57+00:00","id":"694a201e-bf57-452c-83a7-3c94e82c5413","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-15T17:03:57+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69403f7d33c7ace9c4a4220e/2512-0159-product-recall-Kelly-Hoppen-Cups.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Kelly Hoppen Debossed Cappuccino Cups sold by Marks and Spencer</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries and burns as it may crack or break unexpectedly during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Kitchen/Cooking Accessories – Mugs/Cups (Non Disposable)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Kelly Hoppen</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Thailand</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Ceramic mugs for hot drinks in white, black and taupe. For a full list of product identifiers, please see Annex A in the linked PDF.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_694a201e-bf57-452c-83a7-3c94e82c5413\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69403f7d33c7ace9c4a4220e/2512-0159-product-recall-Kelly-Hoppen-Cups.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The base of the ceramic cup may crack or break unexpectedly during normal use, particularly when filled with hot liquids. This sudden failure can result in sharp ceramic fragments, posing a risk of cuts or lacerations to the user. Additionally, the breakage may cause hot liquid to spill, increasing the risk of burns or scalds.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users.  </p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using the product immediately and return it to any M&amp;S store for a full refund.  </p>\n\n<p>Please visit <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://assets.digitalcontent.marksandspencer.app/image/upload/v1764843769/KELLY_HOPPEN_T34_1332B_RECAL_POSTER.pdf\">Product Recalls - M&amp;S</a> for further information, or contact Customer Services via the M&amp;S website or on 0333 014 8555.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0159</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-15T17:04:48Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"kitchen-cooking-accessories","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-15","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-15T17:04:48+00:0